    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_a_01",
      "hash64": "374EC4ECC983AA5C",
      "text": "這裡是天星隊中\\n邊緣份子的家。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_a_02",
      "hash64": "374EC7ECC983AF75",
      "text": "星塵？宣戰？\\n……我們什麼都不知道啊。\\r\\n我們不和總部的人聯絡的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_a_03",
      "hash64": "374EC6ECC983ADC2",
      "text": "雖然我沒辦法招待[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳什麼……\\n這個就給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
