      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_a_05",
      "hash64": "374EC0ECC983A390",
      "text": "這裡是天星隊中\\n邊緣份子的家。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_b_01",
      "hash64": "61CCBCE1801AED13",
      "text": "我們只是厭倦了天星隊的活動，\\n平時也悄悄地有去上學喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_c_01",
      "hash64": "5EDE10DC579B18FE",
      "text": "今天也要充滿活力地說，\\n今天星苦了～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_025_sitappa_d_01",
      "hash64": "895C88D10E333535",
      "text": "這裡誰也不會起爭執，\\n所以待起來很舒服～\\r\\n比起學校、天星隊或家裡，這裡最自在。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
